<topic id="GUID-BE76259D-D7DD-4D82-9E1E-3D5C788610B8" xml:lang="en-US" xmlns:ditaarch="http://dita.oasis-open.org/architecture/2005/" ditaarch:DITAArchVersion="1.2" domains="(topic hi-d)                             (topic ut-d)                             (topic indexing-d)                            (topic hazard-d)                            (topic abbrev-d)                            (topic pr-d)                             (topic sw-d)                            (topic ui-d)                             (topic intc-trackChanges-d)                            (topic equation-d)                            (topic mathml-d)   " class="- topic/topic "> 
  <title class="- topic/title ">TME BIOS Programming Steps </title> 
  <body class="- topic/body "> 
    <p class="- topic/p "> BIOS enables the memory encryption capability very early stage of the BIOS boot process after MRC is complete and before MRC_DONE event. 
    <ol id="OL_7446F597D5474FC9AB6AE690C8FBBD9D" class="- topic/ol "> 
      <li id="LI_2DB9EB7FD4BB486CBC96ADB74C54A7A1" class="- topic/li "> BIOS must detect VT-d is enabled. If VT-d is disabled than BIOS must skip MKTME initialization. VT-d must be enabled in BIOS for TME to work seamlessly. 
      </li> 
      <li id="LI_80794A999C334F4082261058F4EEBD30" class="- topic/li "> BIOS shall detect TME existence of TME MSRs (981h - 984h) when CPUID.7.0.ECX.13 = 1. 
      </li> 
      <li id="LI_906A7FBA45AD440CB67279983C3936BA" class="- topic/li "> BIOS shall detect PCONFIG existence when CPUID.7.0.EDX.18 =1 &amp; CPUID.1B.0.EAX = 1. 
      </li> 
      <li id="LI_91FBE94E2FCE46FDAD3A16FA5C79CD76" class="- topic/li "> BIOS must skip TME flow either above step#1 or #2 or #3 are not satisfied. BIOS should not access any TME MSRs otherwise GP# will occur. 
      </li> 
      <li id="LI_8F112AE2817B4E329DD8DB8777F36C99" class="- topic/li "> 
        <p class="- topic/p ">The CCE0/CCE1 enablement must occur before memory training (BIOS MRC). The CCE is enabled/disabled as per the following rules: 
        </p> 
        <table id="TABLE_E0BFDF42FFB24F1394EDEE9C36DD78DF" class="- topic/table "> 
          <tgroup cols="4" class="- topic/tgroup "> 
            <colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="1.44*" class="- topic/colspec " /> 
            <colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="1.96*" class="- topic/colspec " /> 
            <colspec colnum="3" colname="col3" colwidth="1.40*" class="- topic/colspec " /> 
            <colspec colnum="4" colname="col4" colwidth="1.00*" class="- topic/colspec " /> 
            <thead class="- topic/thead "> 
              <row class="- topic/row "> 
                <entry class="- topic/entry "> Functions Enabled 
                </entry> 
                <entry class="- topic/entry "> BIOS_PARAM_INFO.FEATURES 
                </entry> 
                <entry class="- topic/entry "> Memory Population 
                </entry> 
                <entry class="- topic/entry "> CCEs Enabled 
                </entry> 
              </row></thead> 
            <tbody class="- topic/tbody "> 
              <row class="- topic/row "> 
                <entry class="- topic/entry "> TME on, PRMRR on/off 
                </entry> 
                <entry class="- topic/entry "> Don't Care 
                </entry> 
                <entry class="- topic/entry "> MC0 only 
                </entry> 
                <entry class="- topic/entry "> CCE0 
                </entry> 
              </row> 
              <row class="- topic/row "> 
